<speak>At least he's chosen somewhere that leaves your papers alone. We are approaching the closing part of the call, so I'll give you a moment to put the household sheet aside. Please stay comfortably seated; there is no need to reopen the portal. We can finish the main conversation first, then leave you with a tidy set of administrative notes. If there is another scheduling preference you wanted to mention, you can keep it for the end rather than searching for it right now.</speak>